    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NaNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo></mover><msub><mi>NaNO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>(Thermally stable and does not undergo decomposition further)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ba</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo></mover><mi>Ba</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>Ba</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn><mi>BaO</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p>",
